        "calls": 1,
        "text": "The service now sends a clear signal to the app when your account has enough access to skip seeing the button that offers a higher plan. This applies to users on the free tier who have the most available sessions, so they are no longer prompted to pay for upgrades that do not add value for their current usage. If you are on one of the two highest free tiers, you will stop seeing the upgrade prompt in your app interface, while other users will continue to see it as usual.",
